{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.2023a.q34.material.recovered", "text": "材料：下面是高中政治在学业水平测试中的一道选择题。工业遗产的开发利用是城市转型发展亟待解决的问题。许多城市巧妙利用闲置的厂房和设备，精心打造文创产业园、时尚设计园、爱国主义教育基地等，厂房变成博物馆，仓库改成音乐厅，厂区转为影视基地……工业遗产的“华丽转身”表明（ ）。①事物间的联系是客观的，与人的意识无关②把握联系的多样性是正确认识和有效利用事物的前提③事物发展的关键在于把事物的内部联系转变为外部联系④人们可以通过实践调整事物之间原有的联系，建立新的联系A.①② B.①③ C.②④ D.③④", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "34d4addd1c6523f1165ca9e6c60fd89f1b7d17530cf5bb699564aa441c635fda", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4823, "decoded_csv_character_end": 5072, "next_source_question_number": 34, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 34, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "34d4addd1c6523f1165ca9e6c60fd89f1b7d17530cf5bb699564aa441c635fda"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.2023a.q34"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.s1.k04", "ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.s1.k05", "ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.s4.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.manage", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.409.r002", "ntce.outline.409.r017"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.2023a.q34"], "word_count": 249, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "zhengzhi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "34d4addd1c6523f1165ca9e6c60fd89f1b7d17530cf5bb699564aa441c635fda", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4823, "decoded_csv_character_end": 5072, "next_source_question_number": 34, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"