{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.2023a.q35.material.recovered", "text": "【资料】教学我国的社会主义市场经济体制。节选片段一：使市场在资源配置中起决定性作用。计划和市场是配置资源的两种基本手段。如果计划在资源配置中起决定性作用，就是计划经济体制；如果市场在资源配置中起决定性作用，就是市场经济体制。改革开放以前，我国实行的是计划经济体制；改革开放后，我国逐步建立了社会主义市场经济体制。片段二：我国政府的经济职能和作用包括质量监管。通过市场监管、质量监管、安全监管，规范市场秩序，保障公平竞争，弥补市场缺陷。通过加强和优化公共服务，保障社会公平正义，促进共同富裕，更好满足人民日益增长的美好生活需要。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "34d4addd1c6523f1165ca9e6c60fd89f1b7d17530cf5bb699564aa441c635fda", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 5165, "decoded_csv_character_end": 5428, "next_source_question_number": 35, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 35, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "34d4addd1c6523f1165ca9e6c60fd89f1b7d17530cf5bb699564aa441c635fda"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.2023a.q35"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.s1.k09", "ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.design", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.409.r003", "ntce.outline.409.r005", "ntce.outline.409.r006", "ntce.outline.409.r009", "ntce.outline.409.r012"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.2023a.q35"], "word_count": 263, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "zhengzhi", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "34d4addd1c6523f1165ca9e6c60fd89f1b7d17530cf5bb699564aa441c635fda", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 5165, "decoded_csv_character_end": 5428, "next_source_question_number": 35, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt